      "metadata": {
        "date": "1997-12-06",
        "title": "Cavern",
        "url": "https://phish.in/blob/hx5z9d5nwm1ja8mo47qigmx059e6.mp3",
        "sha256": "8ead55db627ca4f97db72691b4c465b3908be448c198e8e53d32a5e214a02e42",
        "duration": 331.986667,
        "source_notes": "PHiSH - 12/06/97 \r\nPalace of Auburn Hills\r\nAuburn Hills, Michigan\r\n\r\nTaper: Jason Wilhelm\r\nSource:  Microtech Geffel 210 > OADE M248 > SBM -1 > DA-P1\r\n\r\nTransfer:  Panasonic SV-3700 > HHB CDR-800 > CD > HD(via EAC) > Pro Tools 5.0 > WAV > SHN\r\nTransfered by: Alsosprach & Mattstick\r\n\r\n\r\n**DO NOT ENCODE INTO MP3.......WHAT DID THIS SHOW EVER DO TO YOU**\r\n\r\nDisc One **needs 80 min disc** \r\nSet I\r\n1) Golgi Apparatus\r\n2) Run Like an Antelope \r\n3) Trainsong >\r\n4) Bathtub Gin > \r\n5) Foam \r\n6) Sample in a Jar \r\n7) Fee >\r\n8) Maze \r\n9) Cavern \r\n\r\n(moving D1T9 to Disc 2 will split the show into two 74 min discs)\r\n\r\nDisc Two\r\nSet II\r\n1) Tweezer > \r\n2) Izabella > \r\n3) Twist Around > \r\n4) Piper \r\n5) Sleeping Monkey >\r\n6) Tweezer Reprise \r\nEncore:\r\n7) Rocky Top \r\n\r\nThanks to westkoast and colin@loveboat.com for the DAT, big props to Harris for the gear...!\r\n\r\nNote: Sector Boundary Errors fixed with shntool 7/03",
